{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0310","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0310:00000039:text","row":40031,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希にお礼をしなきゃな」","en":"“I owe you a proper thank-you, Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904737","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Looks like I owe you some gratitude, Miki.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0310:000001b7:text","row":40032,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「えー、いーですよ、そんな……」","en":"“Oh, no, you don't have to...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904738","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016b:00002","en":"Miki: \"Ehhh, it's fiiine, no biggie...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0310:000001ef:text","row":40033,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"でも期待にもじもじしちゃう美希ちんであった。","en":"So said Miki-kins, squirming with anticipation all the while.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904739","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016b:00003","en":"But the Miki-chin we had here was fidgeting with expectations.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"Miki fidgets in anticipation. Expectations are not an object she physically fidgets with.","remedy":"fidgeting with anticipation","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":61,"start":34,"text":"fidgeting with expectations"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0310:00000233:text","row":40034,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"性欲が羞恥心を塗りつぶす。","en":"Her lust painted over her embarrassment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904740","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016b:00004","en":"Sexual desire paints out the shame.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0310:00000265:text","row":40035,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"ある意味、俺は性欲があるから、外圧に屈さず生きていけるのだ。","en":"In a way, it was my libido that kept me from caving to outside pressure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[